Description
===========

This set consists of Slater-Koster files for hexagonal Boron Nitride
(h-BN) derived using the methodology described in reference [1] but
with GGA (PBE) functionals. These files are specifically provided for
testing and validating the implementation of real-time time-dependent
density-functional tight-binding (RT-TD-DFTB) in periodic systems.

These parameters are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License. (c) 2025, Charly
Medrano.

WARNING: These parameters are intended for tests of real-time TD-DFTB
with periodic boundary conditions. They should not be used for
production.

1. Hybrid functionals for periodic systems in the density functional
tight-binding method Tammo van der Heide, Bálint Aradi, Ben Hourahine,
Thomas Frauenheim, and Thomas A. Niehaus Phys. Rev. Materials 7,
063802 (2023) https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevMaterials.7.063802
